\code{plot_lineage_tree()} draws a \emph{C. elegans} Sulston lineage tree from a
long-format \verb{(cell, time, value)} data frame and colors each branch by
the value column. Unlike \code{\link[=CD_tree_plot]{CD_tree_plot()}}, it supports two resolutions:
}
\details{
