\item \strong{\code{resolution = "timepoint"}} — per-timepoint \code{geom_segment} coloring,
producing a continuous color gradient along each branch. Best for
per-timepoint metrics like position deviation or expression
trajectories. Optional cross-division smoothing via \code{smoothing_w}.
